# React & Inertia Frontend Rules — KPA EMC²

## Component & Page Standards
- **Admin Layout:** Wrap all admin pages in `<AdminLayout title="..." breadcrumbs={...}>`.
- **Inertia Form Handling:** Define explicit `interface FormData` for `useForm<FormData>`.
- **File Upload with PUT:** When updating files via Inertia, use `router.post(url, { _method: 'PUT', ...data })`.
- **Lucide Icons:** Use `lucide-react` for all UI icons.
- **Tailwind CSS:** Use Tailwind utility classes; avoid inline CSS.
- **Language:** Indonesian for all user-visible labels, notifications, and button text.
- **TypeScript:** Strict types, interfaces over type aliases, no unannotated `any`.
